<title>UK: OPEC basket price stood at $23.55 on Monday.</title>
<headline>OPEC basket price stood at $23.55 on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of OPEC's basket of seven crudes stood at $23.55 per barrel on Monday compared with $23.15 last Friday, the OPEC news agency OPECNA said.</p>
<p>The basket comprises Algeria's Saharan Blend, Indonesia's Minas, Nigeria's Bonny Light, Saudi Arabia's Arabian Light, Dubai of the UAE, Venezuela's Tia Juana and Mexico's Isthmus.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7630</p>
</text>
